<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pembayaran Berhasil Dikirim - PT MEMBAHAS SAHAM INDONESIA</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/logo.png">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="antialiased min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">

    <div class="max-w-lg w-full bm-card p-6 md:p-8 text-center my-8 relative">
        
        <!-- LOGO PERUSAHAAN (Hanya Logo) -->
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
            <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-[var(--card-inner)] border border-[var(--card-border)] px-4 py-2 rounded-xl">
                <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo PT Membahas Saham Indonesia" class="h-8 w-auto object-contain">
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- ICON STATUS DIPROSES -->
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5 text-amber-500 text-3xl animate-pulse">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-2xl bm-heading mb-2">Bukti Pembayaran Diterima!</h1>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Terima kasih! Bukti transfer Anda telah berhasil kami terima dan sedang dalam proses verifikasi oleh tim finance.
        </p>

        <!-- KOTAK ESTIMASI -->
        <div class="bg-[var(--card-inner)] border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl p-4 text-left mb-6 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 font-bold text-sm">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                <span>Estimasi Verifikasi 10 menit</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
                Tim kami akan langsung memverifikasi bukti transfer Anda secara kilat. Undangan akses Telegram VIP akan dikirimkan langsung ke email Anda. Pastikan juga untuk mengecek folder <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Spam / Promosi</strong> di email Anda.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- KONTAK CS -->
        <div class="bg-[var(--card-inner)] border border-[var(--card-border)] rounded-xl p-4 text-left mb-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold mb-3">
                ⚠️ Belum menerima email setelah lebih dari 1 jam? Hubungi Customer Service kami:
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <a href="https://t.me/Rendanggedang" target="_blank" 
                   class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[var(--bg-main)] hover:border-[var(--accent-blue)] border border-[var(--card-border)] p-3 rounded-xl text-xs transition">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-telegram text-[var(--accent-blue)] text-xl"></i>
                    <div>
                        <p class="bm-heading">Telegram CS</p>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]">@Rendanggedang</p>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <a href="https://wa.me/6281382568573" target="_blank" 
                   class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-[var(--bg-main)] hover:border-emerald-500 border border-[var(--card-border)] p-3 rounded-xl text-xs transition">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-emerald-600 text-xl"></i>
                    <div>
                        <p class="bm-heading">WhatsApp CS</p>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]">+62 813-8256-8573</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TOMBOL HOME -->
        <a href="/" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 hover:opacity-90 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl shadow-md transition inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i>
            <span>Kembali ke Beranda</span>
        </a>

    </div>

    <script>
        const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'light';
        document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', savedTheme);
    </script>
</body>
</html>